      "content": "\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">📚 什么是\"变化\"？</h2>\n      \n      <div class=\"concept-card\">\n        <p><span class=\"emoji-big\">🚗</span> <strong>导数</strong>告诉我们：<strong>事物变化的快慢</strong></p>\n        <p>就像：</p>\n        <p>🏎️ 赛车跑得<strong>很快</strong> → 变化<strong>快</strong></p>\n        <p>🐢 乌龟爬得<strong>很慢</strong> → 变化<strong>慢</strong></p>\n      "
    },
